  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Is there a test for the Beta to see how many cores are actually being used?\nThe largest obstacle for my computer right now, is that it limits at 12-25% CPU (4 phsical core put in 8 virtual core) in the standard client. \n\nIs there a way to test this in the 2017 release? I went to a karaoke and dance world to try and get some comparison, but it seems other player avatars are the only reliable activator I have right now to look at, and as you know the Beta zones are pretty empty.",
